[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣の討伐に、犯罪者集団の撃退……！？\nレスナ、やっぱりすごい人だったんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Defeating an Apexi, dismantling a criminal organization...!? Resna, you're incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そんなことは……\n皆さんが協力してくれたおかげだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, I'm not... It was all thanks to everyone's help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやいや。その功績を認められて王国の支援まで\n勝ち取ったんでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those achievements even earned you the approval of the kingdom, didn't they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなのもう、ランターナ王国の英雄じゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That practically makes you a hero of Lantarna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう！\u3000レスナちゃんは英雄なんだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! Resna is a bona fide hero!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいなあ～……眩しいなぁ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's so cool!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシも、堅苦しい教えがなかったら、\n\u3000こんな風になれた可能性もあったのかな……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If it weren't for all our strict teachings, I wonder if I could have walked the same path...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（錬金術で国の危機を救い、\n\u3000みんなから称賛される英雄に……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A hero praised by everyone for saving the country through alchemy...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら、アルビーもついてったらどうだい？\n果ての大陸とやらを探す旅に。楽しそうじゃないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why don't you go with them, Alvie? On their quest to find World's End. It could be fun."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今からでも、遅くない……のかな）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder... perhaps it's not too late...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今度は、アルビーナの話を聞かせて。\nお師匠様との話とか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tell me about yourself, Alvina. What was your mentor like?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つめたっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's c-cold!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ、雨？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, rain?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちっ、いきなり荒れてきやがった。\nトトリ！\u3000波の様子はどうだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch, the weather's not looking good all of a sudden. Totori! How're the waves looking?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のところは大丈夫そうですけど……\nえっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They seem fine for now, but... Eh!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
